  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and TST in BCG-vaccinated individuals without active TB: DST 5mm vs TST 5mm 52.30% (Starshinova 2018 28.34%, Yablonskiy 2013 76.74%) and C-TST vs TST 5mm 16.67% (Xu 2021). The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 38.76% (14.09–70.94) across 519 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وTST لدى الأفراد الملقَّحين بلقاح BCG غير المصابين بالسل النشط: DST 5 مم مقابل TST 5 مم 52.30% (Starshinova 2018 بنسبة 28.34%، وYablonskiy 2013 بنسبة 76.74%)، وC-TST مقابل TST 5 مم 16.67% (Xu 2021). ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 38.76% (14.09–70.94) لدى 519 مشاركاً.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "森林图显示接种卡介苗且无活动性结核病者中TBST与TST的一致率（%）：DST 5mm对TST 5mm为52.30%（Starshinova 2018为28.34%，Yablonskiy 2013为76.74%），C-TST对TST 5mm为16.67%（Xu 2021）。519名参与者的总体随机效应合并一致率为38.76%（14.09–70.94）。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagrama de bosque de la concordancia porcentual entre las TBST y la TST en personas vacunadas con BCG sin TB activa: DST 5 mm frente a TST 5 mm 52,30% (Starshinova 2018 28,34%, Yablonskiy 2013 76,74%) y C-TST frente a TST 5 mm 16,67% (Xu 2021). La concordancia combinada global es del 38,76% (14,09–70,94) en 519 participantes.",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
